# Pairs with HandOffMeetsCoreClose (H -> C). CloseHeadMonotone is dropped, so after the
# re-created incarnation's first initialisation records a head, a later window's close
# records a lower one and lowers the heads L's marker requires.
MODULE: HandOffMeetsCoreCloseHeadsRegress
TARGET: HandOffMeetsCoreClose
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: CloseHeadMonotone is dropped

--- FIND
    /\ (~recreated /\ recreated' /\ ~legacy') \/ CloseHeadMonotone
--- REPLACE
    /\ TRUE
--- END
